"status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p012:m0156","start":156,"end":157,"surface":"彬","kind":"person","person_id":"fha_6ju_xi9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p012:m0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"太祖","kind":"person","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p013","text":"　　彬頗飲酒，擯棄形骸。作《蚤虱賦序》曰：「余居貧，布衣十年不制。一袍之縕，有生所託，資其寒暑，無與易之。爲人多病，起居甚疏，縈寢敗絮，不能自釋。兼攝性懈惰，嬾事皮膚，澡刷不謹，澣沐失時，四體，加以臭穢，故葦席蓬纓之間，蚤虱猥流。淫癢渭濩，無時恕肉，探揣擭撮，日不替手。虱有諺言，朝生暮孫。若吾之虱者，無湯沐之慮，絕相弔之憂，宴聚乎久襟爛布之裳，服無改換，搯齧不能加，脫略緩嬾，復不懃於捕討，孫孫息息，三十五歲焉。」其略言皆實錄也。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":38,"last_line":38,"raw_start":1810,"raw_end":2026,"raw_character_offsets":[1810,1811,1812,1813,1814,1815,1816,1817,1818,1819,1820,1821,1822,1823,1824,1825,1826,1827,1828,1829,1830,1831,1832,1833,1834,1835,1836,1837,1838,1839,1840,1841,1842,1843,1844,1845,1846,1847,1848,1849,1850,1851,1852,1853,1854,1855,1856,1857,1858,1859,1860,1861,1862,1863,1864,1865,1866,1867,1868,1869,1870,1871,1872,1873,1874,1875,1876,1877,1878,1879,1880,1881,1882,1883,1884,1885,1886,1887,1888,1889,1890,1891,1892,1893,1894,1895,1896,1897,1898,1899,1900,1901,1902,1903,1904,1905,1906,1907,1908,1909,1910,1911,1912,1913,1914,1915,1916,1917,1918,1919,1920,1921,1922,1923,1924,1925,1926,1927,1928,1929,1930,1931,1932,1933,1934,1935,1936,1937,1938,1939,1940,1941,1942,1943,1944,1945,1946,1947,1948,1949,1950,1951,1952,1953,1954,1955,1956,1957,1958,1959,1960,1961,1962,1963,1964,1965,1966,1967,1968,1969,1970,1971,1972,1973,1974,1975,1976,1977,1978,1979,1980,1981,1982,1983,1984,1985,1986,1987,1988,1989,1990,1991,1992,1993,1994,1995,1996,1997,1998,1999,2000,2001,2002,2003,2004,2005,2006,2007,2008,2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p013:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"彬","kind":"person","person_id":"fha_6ju_xi9","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014","text":"　　除南海王國郎中令，尚書比部郎，安吉令，車騎記室。彬性好飲酒，以瓠壺瓢勺杬皮爲肴，著帛冠十二年不改易，以大瓠爲火籠，什物多諸詭異。自稱「卞田居」，婦爲「傅蠶室」。或諫曰：「卿都不持操，名器何由得升？」彬曰：「擲五木子，十擲輙鞬，豈復是擲子之拙。吾好擲，政極此耳。」永元中，爲平越長史、綏建太守，卒官。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":40,"last_line":40,"raw_start":2028,"raw_end":2179,"raw_character_offsets":[2028,2029,2030,2031,2032,2033,2034,2035,2036,2037,2038,2039,2040,2041,2042,2043,2044,2045,2046,2047,2048,2049,2050,2051,2052,2053,2054,2055,2056,2057,2058,2059,2060,2061,2062,2063,2064,2065,2066,2067,2068,2069,2070,2071,2072,2073,2074,2075,2076,2077,2078,2079,2080,2081,2082,2083,2084,2085,2086,2087,2088,2089,2090,2091,2092,2093,2094,2095,2096,2097,2098,2099,2100,2101,2102,2103,2104,2105,2106,2107,2108,2109,2110,2111,2112,2113,2114,2115,2116,2117,2118,2119,2120,2121,2122,2123,2124,2125,2126,2127,2128,2129,2130,2131,2132,2133,2134,2135,2136,2137,2138,2139,2140,2141,2142,2143,2144,2145,2146,2147,2148,2149,2150,2151,2152,2153,2154,2155,2156,2157,2158,2159,2160,2161,2162,2163,2164,2165,2166,2167,2168,2169,2170,2171,2172,2173,2174,2175,2176,2177,2178],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"彬","kind":"person","person_id":"fha_6ju_xi9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014:m0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"卞田居","kind":"person","person_id":"fha_6ju_xi9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014:m0077","start":77,"end":80,"surface":"傅蠶室","kind":"person","person_id":"oyc_1n0_hej","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p014:m0101","start":101,"end":102,"surface":"彬","kind":"person","person_id":"fha_6ju_xi9","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p015","text":"　　彬又目禽獸云：「羊性淫而狠，豬性卑而率，鵝性頑而傲，狗性險而出。」皆指斥貴勢。其蝦蟆賦云：「紆青拖紫，名爲蛤魚。」世謂比令僕也。又云：「科斗唯唯，羣浮闇水。維朝繼夕，聿役如鬼。」比令史諮事也。文章傳於閭巷。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":42,"last_line":42,"raw_start":2181,"raw_end":2286,"raw_character_offsets":[2181,2182,2183,2184,2185,2186,2187,2188,2189,2190,2191,2192,2193,2194,2195,2196,2197,2198,2199,2200,2201,2202,2203,2204,2205,2206,2207,2208,2209,2210,2211,2212,2213,2214,2215,2216,2217,2218,2219,2220,2221,2222,2223,2224,2225,2226,2227,2228,2229,2230,2231,2232,2233,2234,2235,2236,2237,2238,2239,2240,2241,2242,2243,2244,2245,2246,2247,2248,2249,2250,2251,2252,2253,2254,2255,2256,2257,2258,2259,2260,2261,2262,2263,2264,2265,2266,2267,2268,2269,2270,2271,2272,2273,2274,2275,2276,2277,2278,2279,2280,2281,2282,2283,2284,2285],"revision_id":2371079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete:p015:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"彬","kind":"person","person_id":"fha_6ju_xi9","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-052","source_id":"s-nanqishu-052-early-literature-complete-ws2371079","source":{"title":"南齊書卷五十二·丘靈鞠、檀超、卞彬、丘巨源","provider":"Wikisource","perma